}, "options": {}}, "position": [-3120, -760], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if", "typeVersion": 2.2}, {"id": "ce041632-5c3e-4f15-b772-cde890181ab7", "name": "Split Out", "parameters": {"fieldToSplitOut": "message.content", "options": {}}, "position": [-1724, -1080], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut", "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "61d7bb88-1ad8-48d7-ae56-953123ccd501", "name": "Workflow Overview", "parameters": {"color": 5, "content": "## \ud83d\udcca Daily Activity Tracker Workflow\n\n**Overview:** Automatically collects Jonathan's daily activity and builds a timesheet in Google Sheets. Runs every day at 7PM.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- \ud83d\udce7 Tracks important emails (filters out newsletters & no-reply)\n- \ud83d\udcc5 Logs calendar events with duration and attendees\n- \ud83d\udcbb Records GitHub commits and pull requests\n- \ud83e\udd16 Uses AI to generate concise activity descriptions\n- \ud83d\udcdd Auto-creates monthly sheets and organizes entries\n\n**Setup:** Connect your credentials in n8n (Google Calendar, Gmail, GitHub, OpenAI, Google Sheets) and pick your timesheet spreadsheet in the two Google Sheets nodes.", "height": 380, "width": 640}, "position": [-4200, -1620], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "ddefaf28-97c9-493b-8762-0d67e8adb345", "name": "Data Collection", "parameters": {"color": 3, "content": "## \ud83d\udd04 Data Collection Hub\n\n**Sources:**\n- **Gmail:** Fetches today's emails (filtered by sender = jtcombs95@gmail.com)\n- **Google Calendar:** Gets today's confirmed events\n- **GitHub API:** Retrieves commits via custom API call\n- **GitHub Node:** Pulls all PRs from tracked repos (all 8 of Jonathan's own repos)\n\n**Note:** Uses today's date \u2014 the 7PM run writes today's timesheet.", "height": 280, "width": 480}, "position": [-3280, -1900], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "011634e4-2d08-40ac-9545-12b06a370e79", "name": "GitHub Filtering", "parameters": {"color": 6, "content": "## \ud83d\udd0d GitHub Activity Filtering\n\n**Commit Filter:**\n- Only includes commits by Jonathancombs782\n- Fetches today's commits (UTC)\n\n**PR Filters:**\n1. **Created Today:** New PRs opened by Jonathancombs782\n2. **Closed Today:** PRs that were merged/closed\n\n**Purpose:** Ensures only relevant GitHub activity is tracked in the timesheet", "height": 340, "width": 580}, "position": [-3360, -340], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "c02e7286-fe56-4719-84ae-d75591814c67", "name": "Sheet Management", "parameters": {"color": 2, "content": "## \ud83d\udccb Sheet Management\n\n**Monthly Sheet Creation:**\n- Automatically creates a new sheet for each month\n- Names sheets using month name (e.g., \"October\")\n- Checks if sheet already exists to avoid duplicates\n\n**Header Row Setup:**\n- Creates header row with Date, Type, Description columns\n- Only runs on first execution of the month", "height": 280, "width": 420}, "position": [-4360, -920], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "d24c8f38-772f-47c7-8be5-62b0bf3bb45b", "name": "Data Aggregation", "parameters": {"color": 7, "content": "## \ud83d\udd00 Data Aggregation\n\n**Purpose:** Combines multiple items into single data objects\n\n**Aggregate Nodes:**\n- **Emails \u2192 emails[]**\n- **Calendar Events \u2192 calendarEvents[]**\n- **Commits \u2192 commits[]**\n- **Pull Requests \u2192 prs[]**\n\n**Merge Node:** Combines all aggregated data into one payload for AI processing", "height": 320, "width": 620}, "position": [-2600, -1480], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "5c550d91-2e03-40a7-848b-f1a84e6a335a", "name": "Final Output", "parameters": {"color": 4, "content": "## \ud83d\udcbe Final Output\n\n**Google Sheets2 Node:**\n- Appends each activity to the current month's sheet\n- Maps AI-generated data:\n  - **Type:** CALENDAR_EVENT | EMAIL | COMMIT | PR\n  - **Description:** Concise activity summary\n  - **Date:** Today's date (YYYY-MM-DD format)\n\n**Result:** Clean, organized timesheet ready for review!", "height": 280, "width": 420}, "position": [-1780, -1440], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "9c66ce99-54b4-43c1-bd72-c03b583355f1", "name": "Sticky Note1", "parameters": {"color": 4, "content": "## \ud83e\udd16 AI Processing & Summary\n\n**Purpose:** Transform raw activity data into structured timesheet entries\n\n**Process:**\n1. **Format All Data** node consolidates data from all sources\n2. **OpenAI GPT-4o-mini** generates concise descriptions (\u2264120 chars)\n3. **Split Out** node separates individual events for sheet insertion\n\n**Output:** Clean, categorized entries ready for Google Sheets", "height": 280, "width": 540}, "position": [-2220, -840], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "bf6a9ad5-11b6-46f5-b4e1-8f7cbed04c56", "name": "Split Out1", "parameters": {"fieldToSplitOut": "repositoriesToTrack", "options": {}}, "position": [-3380, -980], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut", "typeVersion": 1}, {"id": "17c57291-2bbc-4fbb-b2c3-2c7352c379f2", "name": "Get Commits From Github", "parameters": {"authentication": "predefinedCredentialType", "nodeCredentialType": "githubApi", "options": {}, "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/{{ $('Set Variables').item.json.github_handle }}/{{ $json.repositoriesToTrack }}/commits?since={{ $now.startOf('day').toUTC().toISO() }}\n  &until={{ $now.endOf('day').toUTC().toISO() }}"}, "position": [-3220, -980], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "credentials": {"githubApi": {"id": "", "name": "GitHub - JTCombs"}, "httpHeaderAuth": {"id": "", "name": "GitHub Header Auth"}}}, {"id": "df7ad87d-f6e1-4d26-8551-c503271dbb3a", "name": "Insert Sheets Entry", "parameters": {"columns": {"mappingMode": "defineBelow", "matchingColumns": [], "schema": [{"canBeUsedToMatch": true, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "displayName": "Date", "id": "Date", "removed": false, "required": false, "type": "string"}, {"canBeUsedToMatch": true, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "displayName": "Description", "id": "Description", "removed": false, "required": false, "type": "string"}, {"canBeUsedToMatch": true, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "displayName": "Type", "id": "Type", "removed": false, "required": false, "type": "string"}], "value": {"Date": "={{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd') }}", "Description": "={{ $json.description }}", "Type": "={{ $json.type }}"}}, "operation": "append", "options": {}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "mode": "name", "value": "={{ $now.format('MMMM') }}"}, "documentId": {"__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": ""}}, "position": [-1504, -1080], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.6, "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "", "name": "Google Sheets - JTCombs"}}}, {"id": "122a1907-1eb5-48c2-9fb7-4d004f41c74a", "name": "Create Sheet If It Doesn't Exist", "parameters": {"documentId": {"__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": ""}, "operation": "create", "options": {}, "title": "={{ $now.format('MMMM') }}", "alwaysOutputData": true}, "position": [-4500, -560], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.6, "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "", "name": "Google Sheets - JTCombs"}}}, {"id": "a172be21-11f1-48a5-bf6c-2989d3888771", "name": "If it didn't exist", "parameters": {"conditions": {"combinator": "and", "conditions": [{"id": "b177902a-8b12-4147-afe2-babd21126e4a", "leftValue": "={{ $json.title }}", "operator": {"name": "filter.operator.exists", "operation": "exists", "singleValue": true, "type": "string"}}], "options": {"caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2}}, "options": {}}, "position": [-4280, -560], "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if", "typeVersion": 2.2}, {"id": "9d96d32c-75db-4712-8e8f-8806cb43830b", "name": "Init Sheet Headers", "parameters": {"assignments": {"assignments": [{"id": "2e5a5c68-ec1c-4307-b7ab-4db2d0a510d7", "name": "Date", "type"